17692417,2025-12-03,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"TransUnion has repeatedly violated the Fair Credit Reporting Act in its handling of my identity theft disputes. After submitting a full FTC Identity Theft Report, my ID, proof of address, and a detailed written dispute, TransUnion sent a notice refusing to block identity-theft-related accounts as required under FCRA 605B.

