17754666,2025-12-04,Student loan,Federal student loan servicing,Dealing with your lender or servicer,Received bad information about your loan,"I have a letter from Ed financial that I was due to start my repayments in XXXX of XXXX. I am filing this complaint because Edfinancial Services processed an application on my federal student loan account that I explicitly asked them to cancel in XX/XX/XXXX. I communicated to them that I did not want the application to be processed and believed it had been canceled. 

