XX/XX/year> : One week after the mail was delivered, I called Citi Customer Service to check the status. The representative explicitly stated that they had not received the form and that the mail was likely lost. They instructed me to send a new copy of the same form. 

Late XX/XX/year> : Relying on the representative 's statement that the first form was lost, I followed instructions and mailed the exact same form again. 

XX/XX/year> : Without warning, Citi closed all my existing credit card accounts ( not just the new ones ) and forfeited all accumulated rewards points. 

XX/XX/year> : I contacted Citi Customer Service to appeal the closure. The representative explicitly stated that a supervisor would contact me to resolve the issue. I never received this call. 

