18263172,2025-12-23,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"I am writing to formally dispute and request the removal of multiple hard inquiries that appear on my credit report. These inquiries were either unauthorized, excessive, duplicative, or the result of rate shopping for auto financing, and therefore should not be negatively impacting my credit profile. 
