18277723,2025-12-24,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Closing your account,Company closed your account,"I am submitting this complaint regarding Prospers unilateral closure of my credit account without prior notice and the subsequent allegation that I opened the account with intent to commit fraud. 

