18299581,2025-12-26,Debt collection,Rental debt,Took or threatened to take negative or legal action,Threatened or suggested your credit would be damaged,"I am filing this complaint regarding inaccurate and misleading credit reporting by FAIR COLLECTION in violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ). 

