18369616,2025-12-30,Debt collection,Other debt,Communication tactics,Called before 8am or after 9pm,"I am submitting this complaint against TD Bank regarding improper billing practices, lack of accurate communication, and unjust interest charges related to a retail financing account for a sofa purchase held in the name of my husband, XXXX XXXX. 

