18384133,2025-12-30,Debt collection,Credit card debt,Took or threatened to take negative or legal action,Threatened to sue you for very old debt,"To Whom It May Concern, I am submitting this formal complaint against Pressler & Pressler , LLP, a debt collection law firm, for ongoing, willful, and repeated violations of the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ). This firm has continued to engage in collection activity after receiving multiple written cease-and-desist notices and despite clear evidence that the alleged debt dates back to 2016, based on the collection statements they themselves mailed to me. 

